# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli string action on a computational basis state {#pauli-string-action-on-a-computational-basis-state}"
msgstr "تأثير سلسلة باولي على حالة أساس حسابية {#pauli-string-action-on-a-computational-basis-state}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The action of a Pauli string on a computational basis state is rather trivial, and is a single computational basis state itself. This is a direct consequence of the structure of Pauli matrices, which only have a single nonzero element on each of their rows. Consequently, their action on a qubit is:\n"
msgstr "تأثير سلسلة باولي على حالة أساس حسابية بسيط نسبيًا، وناتجه حالة أساس حسابية واحدة. وهذه نتيجة مباشرة لبنية مصفوفات باولي، التي لا يحتوي كل صف فيها إلا على عنصر واحد غير صفري. وبالتالي يكون تأثيرها على الكيوبت كما يلي:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |0 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |0 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |1 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |1 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |0 \\rangle = i|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |0 \\rangle = i|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |1 \\rangle = -i|0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |1 \\rangle = -i|0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |1 \\rangle = -|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |1 \\rangle = -|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"I |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"I |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"I |1 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"I |1 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each bit on the bitstring labeling the computational basis will be labeled by $x \\in \\{0, 1 \\}$. In order to keep the implementation at light as possible, we will\n"
"represent the bitstrings with `bool` variables: $0\\rightarrow \\textrm{False}$ and\n"
"$1\\rightarrow \\textrm{True}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"سيُرمَز لكل بت في سلسلة البتات التي تعنون الأساس الحسابي بالرمز $x \\in \\{0, 1 \\}$. ولإبقاء التنفيذ خفيفًا قدر الإمكان، سنمثّل سلاسل البتات بمتغيرات من النوع `bool`: $0\\rightarrow \\textrm{False}$ و\n"
"$1\\rightarrow \\textrm{True}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To represent the action of each Pauli operator in a computational basis state,\n"
"we will assign three variables to it: `diag`, `sign`, `imag`.\n"
msgstr "لتمثيل تأثير كل معامل باولي على حالة أساس حسابية، سنسند إليه ثلاثة متغيرات: `diag` و`sign` و`imag`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`diag` labels whether the operator is diagonal:\n"
msgstr "يحدد `diag` ما إذا كان المعامل قطريًا:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(I) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(I) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- `sign` Identifies if there is a sign change in the matrix element connected\n"
"to either 0 or 1:\n"
msgstr "- يحدد `sign` ما إذا كان هناك تغيير في الإشارة في عنصر المصفوفة المرتبط بالقيمة 0 أو 1:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`imag` Identifies if there is a complex component to the matrix element:\n"
msgstr "يحدد `imag` ما إذا كان عنصر المصفوفة يحتوي على مركّبة مركبة (تخيلية):\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We label an arbitrary Pauli operator as $\\sigma \\in \\{ I, \\sigma_x, \\sigma_y\n"
"\\sigma_z\\}$. The action of the Pauli operator on a computational basis state\n"
"can then be represented by the logic operation:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\sigma |x \\rangle = |x == \\textrm{diag}(\\sigma) \\rangle (-1)^{x\\textrm{ and sign}(\\sigma)}\n"
"(i)^{\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma)}.\n"
"$$\n"
"The same is straightforwardly generalized to arbitrary number of qubits.\n"
"Let's check that this works:\n"
msgstr ""
"نرمز لمعامل باولي اعتباطي بالرمز $\\sigma \\in \\{ I, \\sigma_x, \\sigma_y\n"
"\\sigma_z\\}$. ويمكن تمثيل تأثير معامل باولي على حالة أساس حسابية\n"
"بالعملية المنطقية:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\sigma |x \\rangle = |x == \\textrm{diag}(\\sigma) \\rangle (-1)^{x\\textrm{ and sign}(\\sigma)}\n"
"(i)^{\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma)}.\n"
"$$\n"
"ويُعمَّم ذلك بسهولة على عدد اعتباطي من الكيوبتات.\n"
"لنتحقق من أن هذا يعمل:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We generate some large number of bitstrings (50 M) for a 40-qubit system:\n"
msgstr "نولّد عددًا كبيرًا من سلاسل البتات (50 مليونًا) لنظام من 40 كيوبت:\n"

